        },
        "content": {
          "title": "_i18n_learn_more_topic_about",
          "body": "Traditional Dream Factory is a web3-powered regenerative co-living space in Abela, Portugal. Founded in 2021, we are pioneering a new model for community living that combines modern technology with ancient wisdom about living in harmony with the land.\n\nOur mission is to create positive loops in all interactions between stakeholders—including nature, all life, and future generations. We aim to prove that we can optimize resources while nurturing a creative, thriving community that leaves a positive trace on the environment.\n\nTDF is designed for 80-100 members who continuously return year after year, deepening their connection with the land and each other.",
          "imageUrl": "",
          "imageAlt": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "textBlock",
      "data": {
        "settings": {
          "imagePosition": "none"
        },
        "content": {
          "title": "_i18n_learn_more_topic_location",
          "body": "TDF is located in Abela, Alentejo, Portugal — a rural landscape of cork oaks, hills, and regenerating farmland.",
          "imageUrl": "",
          "imageAlt": ""
        }
      }
